source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: The brace form of `^` renders superscript between word runes.
-- input.jira --
a{^}b{^}c
-- rendered.html --
<p>a<sup>b</sup>c</p>
-- want.md --
a<sup>b</sup>c
